<title>SOUTH AFRICA: The Don Group in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>The Don Group in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Don Group Ltd on Friday said negotiations were in progress which, if successfully concluded, could affect the price of Don shares.</p>
<p>The group advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
